1
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:05,680
Hey.

2
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:09,480
Walk faster, dude.
Why are you rushing? The shop is right there.

3
00:00:10,879 --> 00:00:13,416
So you normally sleep
in the same room as P'Gun?

4
00:00:13,416 --> 00:00:14,937
Yeah.

5
00:00:15,559 --> 00:00:19,206
Then why are you two sleeping separately now?

6
00:00:19,206 --> 00:00:23,242
Because we had to finish
clearing the small room.

7
00:00:23,495 --> 00:00:28,415
Oh, so that's why you didn't come
with us yesterday.

8
00:00:28,415 --> 00:00:29,439
Yeah, that's it.

9
00:00:30,469 --> 00:00:31,925
I was helping him clean up.

10
00:00:32,449 --> 00:00:34,728
It used to be his ex's storage room.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,663
He was super protective of it.
Guess he's over it now, so he let me stay there.

12
00:00:42,091 --> 00:00:47,827
I think he just wants privacy to bring girls over,
so he separated the rooms.

13
00:00:48,701 --> 00:00:53,080
Oh, so that's what you think.
But it's true though.

14
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:07,286
Did you go buy that mattress from
Mars or what? I already bought it.

15
00:01:07,869 --> 00:01:12,216
I'll go set it up in the small room.

16
00:01:12,216 --> 00:01:16,269
No. Tonight you're sleeping with me.

17
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:23,119
I'm not doing it anymore.

18
00:01:24,159 --> 00:01:29,040
Doing what?
Well…

19
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:34,720
*That.*
Is that all you ever think about?

20
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:39,044
You're the one who said
you get turned on when you see me.

21
00:01:39,685 --> 00:01:41,638
If you don't see me,
then you won't get turned on.

22
00:01:43,075 --> 00:01:45,770
You seriously believed I meant that?

23
00:01:46,159 --> 00:01:50,360
Well, didn't you actually feel that way?

24
00:01:51,532 --> 00:01:54,532
Come here.

25
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:59,984
Earth, where are you going?

26
00:01:59,984 --> 00:02:02,159
Let go.

27
00:02:02,799 --> 00:02:08,200
I'm sleeping outside.
Are you mad at me?

28
00:02:09,119 --> 00:02:13,811
Why are you like this? I can't even joke?

29
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,122
Joke?

30
00:02:17,355 --> 00:02:20,278
Then can I punch you as a joke too?

31
00:02:20,278 --> 00:02:23,916
You really hate me that much?

32
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:29,879
Yeah, I f***ing hate you so much.

33
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:36,528
Move.

34
00:02:36,528 --> 00:02:39,560
Earth…

35
00:02:40,959 --> 00:02:45,440
What the hell is wrong with you?
Go.
